Gathers values along an axis specified by `dim`.

For a 3-D tensor the output is specified by::

    out[i][j][k] = input[index[i][j][k]][j][k]  # if dim == 0
    out[i][j][k] = input[i][index[i][j][k]][k]  # if dim == 1
